          "prompt": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>What is the output of the following program?</p><pre><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> java.io.IOException;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Main</span> {\n   <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">static</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">main</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(String[] args)</span> {\n     <span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">k</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">5</span>;\n     <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">try</span> {\n       <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span>(k&gt;<span class=\"hljs-number\">4</span>) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">throw</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">IOException</span>();\n     }\n     <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">catch</span>(IOException e) {\n       System.out.print(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;one &quot;</span>);\n     }\n     <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">catch</span>(Exception e) {\n        System.out.print(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;two &quot;</span>);\n     }\n     <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">finally</span> {\n        System.out.print(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;three&quot;</span>);\n     }\n     System.out.println();\n   }\n}</code></pre></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Kết quả của chương trình sau là gì?</p><pre><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> java.io.IOException;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Main</span> {\n   <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">static</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">main</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(String[] args)</span> {\n     <span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">k</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">5</span>;\n     <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">try</span> {\n       <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span>(k&gt;<span class=\"hljs-number\">4</span>) <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">throw</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">IOException</span>();\n     }\n     <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">catch</span>(IOException e) {\n       System.out.print(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;one &quot;</span>);\n     }\n     <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">catch</span>(Exception e) {\n        System.out.print(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;two &quot;</span>);\n     }\n     <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">finally</span> {\n        System.out.print(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;three&quot;</span>);\n     }\n     System.out.println();\n   }\n}</code></pre></div>",
