          "prompt": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>What will be the result when you attempt to compile and run the following code?</p><pre><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Conv</span>{\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">static</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">main</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(String argv[])</span>{\n        Conv c=<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Conv</span>();\n        String s=<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">String</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;ello&quot;</span>);\n        c.amethod(s);\n    }\n\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">amethod</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(String s)</span>{\n        <span class=\"hljs-type\">char</span> c=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;H&#x27;</span>;\n        c+=s;\n        System.out.println(c);\n    }\n}</code></pre></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Kết quả khi bạn biên dịch và chạy đoạn mã sau là gì?</p><pre><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Conv</span>{\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">static</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">main</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(String argv[])</span>{\n        Conv c=<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Conv</span>();\n        String s=<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">String</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;ello&quot;</span>);\n        c.amethod(s);\n    }\n\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">amethod</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(String s)</span>{\n        <span class=\"hljs-type\">char</span> c=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;H&#x27;</span>;\n        c+=s;\n        System.out.println(c);\n    }\n}</code></pre></div>",
